9. Known Issues
===============

9.1 dm-verity Limitation
------------------------
So far, nvidia-orin BSP doesn't support dm-verity feature. In other words, when setting up nvidia-orin BSP
project, template parameter can't include feature/dm-verity.
If customer wants to support dm-verity feature on NVIDIA Orin platform, please connect with WR Support.
